$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=algrecmapl  LOC_AFTER=?

* Every level of the recursion of ~ df-algrec maps the parameter space into the codomain, by induction on the level.  Used at ` C = ( Cod ^m Dom ) `, where it says that the step may apply the previous level to any parameter.  Deduction form: ~ algrecmap .

s1::id |- ( x = 0 -> x = 0 )
c1:s1:fveq2d |- ( x = 0 -> ( ( B AlgRec S ) ` x ) = ( ( B AlgRec S ) ` 0 ) )
c2:c1:eleq1d |- ( x = 0 -> ( ( ( B AlgRec S ) ` x ) e. C <-> ( ( B AlgRec S ) ` 0 ) e. C ) )
c3:c2:imbi2d |- ( x = 0 -> ( ( ( C e. _V /\ B e. C /\ S : ( C X. NN0 ) --> C ) -> ( ( B AlgRec S ) ` x ) e. C ) <-> ( ( C e. _V /\ B e. C /\ S : ( C X. NN0 ) --> C ) -> ( ( B AlgRec S ) ` 0 ) e. C ) ) )
